  ],
  "texto": [
   "Net sales are expected to be between $240.0 billion and $247.0 billion, or to grow between 12% and 16% compared with fourth quarter 2025. This guidance anticipates an unfavorable impact of approximately 60 basis points from foreign exchange rates. Advertising revenue grew 12% year-over-year excluding changes in foreign exchange rates in the third quarter 2026 impacted by timing anomalies primarily related to Prime Day (and a couple other timing factors). We expect year-over-year advertising reve",
   "Operating income is expected to be between $28.5 billion and $33.5 billion, compared with $25.0 billion in fourth quarter 2025.",
   "We continue to expect 2026 cash capital expenditures to be approximately $220 billion.",
   "This guidance assumes, among other things, no impact from energy derivative contract remeasurements, and that no additional business acquisitions, restructurings, or legal settlements are concluded."
  ],
  "titulo": "Financial Guidance",
  "fuente": "SEC EDGAR · 8-K, Exhibit 99.1 (texto original)",
  "url": "https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1018724/000101872426000038/amzn-20260930xex991.htm",
  "texto_es": [
   "Se esperan unas ventas netas de entre 240.000 y 247.000 M$, un crecimiento de entre el 12% y el 16% frente al 4T25. La guía incluye un efecto desfavorable del tipo de cambio de unos 60 puntos básicos. Los ingresos por publicidad crecieron un 12% interanual sin efecto divisa en el 3T26, afectados por desfases de calendario ligados sobre todo al Prime Day (y algún otro efecto de calendario). Esperamos que el crecimiento interanual de la publicidad…",
   "Se espera un beneficio operativo de entre 28.500 y 33.500 M$, frente a 25.000 M$ en el 4T25.",
   "Seguimos esperando unas inversiones (capex en caja) de unos 220.000 M$ en 2026.",
   "La guía supone, entre otras cosas, que no habrá efecto de la revalorización de contratos de derivados de energía ni nuevas adquisiciones, reestructuraciones o acuerdos judiciales."
  ]
 },
