  "texto_es": [
   "Firmó nuevos contratos de AWS con Meta, NVIDIA, OpenAI, Salesforce, Oracle, Qualcomm, Verizon, ADP, Stripe, Accenture Edge, Novo, Fanatics, Zoom, Raymond James, Prometheus AI, AppFolio, Instructure, Cognition, Sigma, Lila Sciences, The Biological Computing Co., la OTAN, el Columbia University Irving Medical Center y otros.",
